  "modifications": "Preserved the complete 56-file pinned schema-2 database byte-for-byte. Build-time generation retains all camera, lens, mount, alias, crop, aspect, projection and optical calibration records. Duplicate calibration keys use Lensfun 0.3.4 loader last-value-wins semantics; linear TCA is represented by equivalent poly3 zero higher-order terms. No XML parser or native Lensfun dependency is shipped.",
  "opt_in_scope": "Complete database is available to generic exact identity/mount/crop lookup. RAW adapters independently establish source geometry and each operation independently qualifies its calibration. Database inclusion does not assert that absent metadata or absent calibration values exist.",
